**Observation:** There is no dedicated `test:e2e` or `playwright` npm script. E2E tests are invoked via the Makefile instead (see below).

**Makefile E2E target** (at `/Users/srujansai/Desktop/swa-erp/Makefile`, line 44-45):
```makefile
test-e2e:
